-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:345771ce4063141dfdd520382c0a5b23e2d47dd922410c8c5404c8d6d2f7a33c","file":"preprints/The-exact-reconstruction-threshold-for-the-three-state-symmetric-channel-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":44,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"e2e644b7f04e70255d99f5ffcfe1285e4be16369a1a5bc3e643f294eb6193a00","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/The-exact-reconstruction-threshold-for-the-three-state-symmetric-channel-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:345771ce4063141dfdd520382c0a5b23e2d47dd922410c8c5404c8d6d2f7a33c","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/The-exact-reconstruction-threshold-for-the-three-state-symmetric-channel-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L44"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:threshold}\nFor every integer $b\\ge2$ in the regular model and every real $d>1$\nin the Poisson model, reconstruction occurs if and only if\n\\[\n d\\lambda^2>1,\n\\]\nwith $d=b$ in the regular case. At every admissible equality\n$d\\lambda^2=1$, there is non-reconstruction."}
